hexagon-dsp-binaries
====================

These packages provide binaries (FastRPC shell, C++ runtime, compressed audio
decoder modules and other libs) for several Qualcomm platforms.

The libraries are installed in subdirectories under /usr/share/qcom as agreed
with the hexagonrpc ([1]) and fastrpc ([2]) projects, one subdir per device (or
type of devices).

These libraries are loaded at runtime from userspace by the corresponding DSP
daemon or by the user app which wants to use FastRPC functionality.

[1] https://github.com/linux-msm/hexagonrpc
[2] https://github.com/qualcomm/fastrpc

 -- Dmitry Baryshkov <dbaryshkov@gmail.com>, Mon, 18 Aug 2025 17:09:46 +0200
